  evaluation: [['Give three characteristics of mountain climates.', 'Cooler temperatures, more rain on windward slopes, strong winds (and mist).'], ['Why is the leeward side of a mountain drier?', 'Air has lost its rain on the windward side and warms as it sinks.']],
