  objectives: ['Explain the formation and effects of thunderstorms.', 'Explain tornadoes.', 'Explain tropical cyclones and measures against them.'],
  recall: ['Unstable air gives cumulonimbus clouds.', 'Warm seas give much water vapour.'],
